	)
	(text "~{OSEL} is active if\nany of the ~{COL}XX\nare low -> ~{OSEL}1 or ~{OSEL}2\nis active if the pixel is\nnot transparetn. If the pixel is\ntransparent the color value is\ntaken from the LS735 for some reason."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 198.12 177.8 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "a23c5cfb-7446-4efc-8e47-b37f7e081dbb")
	)
	(text "http://www.bitsavers.org/components/fujitsu/_dataBooks/1982_Fujitsu_Memory_DatB_Book.pdf"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 229.87 245.11 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "a2fcdd17-4243-4ed1-b92e-38c8ce39dd46")
	)
	(text "RAM output active when\n~~{OBEN1} & ~~{OBWR1} & OCLK3 & ~~{LB2EN}.\nLB1 RAM ~{CS} is enabled all the time when\n~~{LB2EN}. Correspondingly LB2 when ~{LB2EN} is high.\n\nActive Line Buffers, driving pixels. LB1 and LB2 are active\nhigh.\n\nRead from buffer\n\nActive	~{LB1EN}	~{LB2EN}\nLB1		L		 H\nLB2		H		 L\n"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 347.98 177.8 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "ac68bb56-be8a-4c2a-83a7-b939380e74fa")
	)
	(text "SEL = 0, objects selected\nSEL = 1, tilemap selected"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 280.67 204.47 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "b69175c6-af12-435b-ae4f-d49e65f56315")
	)
	(text "When the buffer is emptied and read out to the color\nmixer each position is first read and then written to.\nThe written value will be 4'b0000 (transparent pixel)\nsince buffers A5/B6 are disabled at this time.\nThe active pixels are from positions 0..247. The drawing\nstarts 44 pixels after horizontal blank.\n\nFlip is not active:\nThe drawing starts 40 pixels after horizontal blanking\ngoes inactive -> pixels 0..242 are displayed.\nFlip is active:\nThe drawing starts 11 pixels before horizontal goes inactive\n-> pixels 0..10 are not displayed. The counter rolls\nover after xpos 255, which is 44 pixels before horizontal\nblanking starts, the pixels displayed then are transparent."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 280.67 196.85 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "cf317e9f-d79a-4514-9baa-0b9beb95dcde")
	)
	(text "White pixel: 4'b1111\nTransparent pixel: 4'b0000"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
